Spatial Data Sources Tree
=========================

GEE (Google Earth Engine)
├── Land Cover
│   ├── src: ESA WorldCover v200
│   ├── url: ee.ImageCollection('ESA/WorldCover/v200')
│   ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_landcover()
│   └── stac: YES - Planetary Computer
│             https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/esa-worldcover
│
├── Elevation
│   ├── src: USGS SRTM 30m
│   ├── url: ee.Image('USGS/SRTMGL1_003')
│   ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_elevation()
│   └── stac: YES - Planetary Computer (Copernicus DEM), AWS Earth Search
│             https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/cop-dem-glo-30
│
├── Forest / Deforestation
│   ├── src: Hansen Global Forest Change v1.11
│   ├── url: ee.Image('UMD/hansen/global_forest_change_2023_v1_11')
│   ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_forest()
│   ├── stac: PARTIAL - MAAP platform (requires special access)
│   │         https://stac-browser.maap-project.org/collections/glad-global-forest-change-1.11
│   └── alt:  Direct download (GeoTIFF tiles, 10x10 degree)
│             https://storage.googleapis.com/earthenginepartners-hansen/GFC-2023-v1.11/
│             COG version: https://github.com/ramiqcom/hansen-global-forest-change
│
├── Land Surface Temperature (LST)
│   ├── src: Landsat 8 Collection 2 Tier 1
│   ├── url: ee.ImageCollection('LANDSAT/LC08/C02/T1_L2')
│   ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_lst()
│   └── stac: YES - Planetary Computer, AWS Earth Search, USGS
│             https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/landsat-c2-l2
│             https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1
│
├── NDVI / NDMI
│   ├── src: Sentinel-2 Harmonized
│   ├── url: ee.ImageCollection('COPERNICUS/S2_HARMONIZED')
│   ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_ndxi()
│   └── stac: YES - Planetary Computer, AWS Earth Search, Copernicus
│             https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/sentinel-2-l2a
│             https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1
│             https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/stac/
│
└── Nighttime Lights
    ├── src: VIIRS DNB Monthly
    ├── url: ee.ImageCollection('NOAA/VIIRS/DNB/MONTHLY_V1/VCMSLCFG')
    ├── py:  backend/gee_fun.py → gee_nightlight()
    ├── stac: OUTDATED - AWS (2012-2020 only)
    │         https://registry.opendata.aws/wb-light-every-night/
    └── alt:  EOG VNL v2.2 (2012-2024, monthly composites, GeoTIFF)
              https://eogdata.mines.edu/products/vnl/
              NASA Black Marble VNP46A2 (2012-present, daily 500m, HDF format)
              https://ladsweb.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/missions-and-measurements/products/VNP46A2/


Direct Download (Public)
├── WSF Evolution
│   ├── src: DLR World Settlement Footprint Evolution
│   ├── url: https://download.geoservice.dlr.de/WSF_EVO/files/
│   └── py:  backend/wsf.py
│
├── WSF Tracker
│   ├── src: DLR World Settlement Footprint Tracker
│   ├── url: https://download.geoservice.dlr.de/WSF_Tracker/
│   └── py:  backend/wsf.py
│
├── GHS Population
│   ├── src: JRC Global Human Settlement Layer R2023A
│   ├── url: https://jeodpp.jrc.ec.europa.eu/ftp/jrc-opendata/GHSL/GHS_POP_GLOBE_R2023A
│   └── py:  backend/ghs_population.py
│
├── GHS Built-Up
│   ├── src: JRC Global Human Settlement Layer R2023A
│   ├── url: https://jeodpp.jrc.ec.europa.eu/ftp/jrc-opendata/GHSL/GHS_BUILT_S_GLOBE_R2023A
│   └── py:  backend/ghs_buildup.py
│
├── FABDEM Elevation
│   ├── src: University of Bristol Global FABDEM
│   ├── url: https://data.bris.ac.uk/datasets/s5hqmjcdj8yo2ibzi9b4ew3sn/
│   └── py:  backend/elevation.py
│
├── Population (WorldPop)
│   ├── src: WorldPop Constrained 100m
│   ├── url: https://hub.worldpop.org/rest/data/pop/cic2020_100m?iso3={iso3}
│   └── py:  backend/main.py
│
└── MS Building Footprints
    ├── src: Microsoft Global ML Building Footprints
    ├── url: https://minedbuildings.z5.web.core.windows.net/global-buildings/dataset-links.csv
    └── py:  backend/buildings.py


GCS Bucket (city-scan-global-data)
├── Burned Area
│   ├── src: MODIS GlobFire MCD64A1
│   ├── blob: GlobFire/
│   └── py:  backend/burned_area.py
│
├── Fire Weather Index
│   ├── src: CRU FWI
│   ├── blob: FWI/
│   └── py:  backend/fwi.py
│
├── Land Cover Burnability
│   ├── src: ESA CCI Land Cover + Burnability Index
│   ├── blob: land_cover/
│   └── py:  backend/landcover_burnability.py
│
├── Relative Wealth Index
│   ├── src: Meta/Facebook RWI
│   ├── blob: RWI/
│   └── py:  backend/rwi.py
│
├── Air Quality
│   ├── src: WHO Air Quality PM2.5
│   ├── blob: air_quality/
│   └── py:  backend/main.py
│
├── Landslide Susceptibility
│   ├── src: NASA LHASA 2.0
│   ├── blob: landslide/
│   └── py:  backend/main.py
│
├── Liquefaction Susceptibility
│   ├── src: USGS Global Liquefaction
│   ├── blob: liquefaction/
│   └── py:  backend/main.py
│
├── Solar Potential
│   ├── src: Global Solar Atlas
│   ├── blob: solar/
│   └── py:  backend/solar.py
│
└── Sea Level Rise
    ├── src: Climate Central / AR6
    ├── blob: slr/
    └── py:  backend/slr.py


AWS S3 (Restricted)
└── Flood Risk (Fathom)
    ├── src: Fathom Global v3.0
    ├── bucket: (WBG AWS - credentials required)
    ├── types: coastal, fluvial, pluvial
    └── py:  backend/fathom.py


API (No Download)
├── OpenStreetMap
│   ├── src: OSM via OSMnx
│   ├── url: https://api.openstreetmap.org/
│   └── py:  backend/accessibility.py, backend/road_network.py
│
├── Demographics
│   ├── src: WorldPop Age-Sex Structures
│   ├── url: https://www.worldpop.org/rest/data/age_structures/ascic_2020?iso3={iso3}
│   └── py:  backend/demographics.py
│
└── Earthquake Events
    ├── src: NOAA NGDC
    ├── url: http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/hazel/hazard-service/api/v1/earthquakes
    └── py:  backend/earthquake_event.py
